<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">People's United Party</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1950">1950</a>–</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The People's United Party is a political party of Belize, founded in 1950 in protest at a currency devaluation in British Honduras. Led by George Price, it campaigned for self-government and independence, won it in 1981 and has since alternated in power with the United Democratic Party.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/peoples-united-party.jpg" alt="People's United Party" width="320" height="213" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Fry1989 eh? · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Belize_People%27s_United_Party.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
